    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The RPG for Everyone&quot;</strong> is a unique <strong>simulation game</strong> where you step into the shoes of a developer to create a classic RPG.<br>Experience the ups and downs of game development as you work toward crafting a masterpiece that everyone will love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the renowned game creator <strong>SECHAN BARAM</strong>, players embark on a journey to design and develop their very own RPG masterpiece.<br>But the road to success is not without challenges.<br>Once your game is released, it will face critiques and feedback from review sites and players.<br>Your ultimate goal? Address these critiques, refine your game step by step, and strive to achieve a <strong>perfect user score of 100</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you create a game that satisfies everyone and avoids criticism?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Development Simulation:</strong><br>Oversee every aspect of creating a traditional RPG, from design decisions to final release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Developer Challenges:</strong><br>Handle player feedback and critiques to continually improve your game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Single-Player Mode:</strong><br>Face compelling challenges and make impactful decisions as you build your RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guidance from SECHAN BARAM:</strong><br>Receive valuable advice and mentorship from a legendary game developer throughout your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425350/extras/a1a3f503e4957edf49da015fec6997e4.avif?t=1738143676\" width=640 height=1390 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The RPG for Everyone&quot;</strong> is a unique <strong>simulation game</strong> where you step into the shoes of a developer to create a classic RPG.<br>Experience the ups and downs of game development as you work toward crafting a masterpiece that everyone will love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the renowned game creator <strong>SECHAN BARAM</strong>, players embark on a journey to design and develop their very own RPG masterpiece.<br>But the road to success is not without challenges.<br>Once your game is released, it will face critiques and feedback from review sites and players.<br>Your ultimate goal? Address these critiques, refine your game step by step, and strive to achieve a <strong>perfect user score of 100</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you create a game that satisfies everyone and avoids criticism?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Development Simulation:</strong><br>Oversee every aspect of creating a traditional RPG, from design decisions to final release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Developer Challenges:</strong><br>Handle player feedback and critiques to continually improve your game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Single-Player Mode:</strong><br>Face compelling challenges and make impactful decisions as you build your RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guidance from SECHAN BARAM:</strong><br>Receive valuable advice and mentorship from a legendary game developer throughout your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425350/extras/a1a3f503e4957edf49da015fec6997e4.avif?t=1738143676\" width=640 height=1390 /></span></p>",
